\pard\plain \ltrch\loch {\f0\fs24\b0 During the lifetime of C.R.C., the order was said to comprise no more than eight members, each a doctor and "all bachelors of vowed virginity".}{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Rosicrucianism#cite_note-16"}{\fldrslt\f0\fs24\b0\super [{\f0\fs24\b0\super 16}{\f0\fs24\b0\super ]}}}{\f0\fs24\b0  Each member undertook an oath to heal the sick without accepting payment, to maintain a secret fellowship, and to find a replacement for himself before he died. Three such generations had supposedly passed between c. 1500 and c. 1600: a time when scientific, philosophical, and religious freedom had grown so that the public might benefit from the Rosicrucians' knowledge, so that they were now seeking good men.}{ }
\par\plain 
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0\i1 The Dawn of Everything}{\f0\fs24\b0  by David Graeber and David Wengrow.}{ }
\par\plain 
\par\pard\plain \sa180\sb180\ltrch\loch {\f0\fs24\b0 Yesterday I wanted to go to wash my motorcycle after my 12 hour night shift.}
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0 I drive out of my underground car park around the first intersection and already see a huge cluster of people (I live in the city) standing around a car at the Kruezung.}
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0 I filter through the whole traffic jam to see what happened and see someone lying under the car who is obviously unconscious...}
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0 So (unfortunately) back 2 work (I'm a nurse) and got off the bike to provide first aid.\line But instead of anyone doing something (e.g. stable lateral position and co), everyone just stands around wildly and pulls out their cell phones TO FUCK FILM AGAIN.}
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0 So after I had picked out my first aiders, the announcement came (because legs are trapped under the car and my "patient" is bleeding from his mouth and both A and D has problems [ABCDE scheme]) to free the legs under the tire (feet were broken anyway, but at least they can still heal, it looks different if he dies away from me).}
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0 So while I'm managing all the bullshit, I notice how constantly cell phones are pointed at me, and as if that wasn't enough, SUCH A DIRTY SON OF A DOG WANTS TO STEAL MY MOTORCYCLE.}
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0 The 1st time I noticed that he was fiddling with my bike and especially with my key, I was already shouting at him loudly "PAWS AWAY FROM THE BIKE OTHERWISE WE HAVE A MUCH BIGGER PROBLEM!" THERE WAS NO REACTION TO THAT AT FIRST AND HE CONTINUED, BUT THEN I GOT VERY, VERY LOUD SO THAT I SUDDENLY HAD ALL THE ATTENTION OF ALL PEOPLE IN A RADIUS OF ABOUT 20 METERS AND ALL PEOPLE LOOKED AT HIM.\line After that, he crawled into the crowd of people to be one of the ones who filmed the whole thing.}
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0 Thank God among the passers-by who happened to be on the road like me, there was also an emergency doctor who then (thank God) took over for me, so that I could take care that all the people who had nothing to do with the shit could be sent away.\line Of course, there was no reaction to the request to leave, so again in a strong voice "ALL THOSE WHO HAVE NOTHING TO DO WITH THIS ARE GONE, CELL PHONES OFF AND OTHER DIRECTIONS GO IMMEDIATELY!".}
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0 So after a much more courageous announcement came, people came back to their shops as well as up and down the street.}
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0 I just don't understand how brazen you have to be to:}
\par\pard\plain \li540\fi-270\sb180\ltrch\loch \ls1\ilvl0{\listtext	\f0\fs24\b0 1.	}{\f0\fs24\b0 Filming all the shit with your phone}
\par\pard\plain \li540\fi-270\ltrch\loch \ls1\ilvl0{\listtext	\f0\fs24\b0 2.	}{\f0\fs24\b0 Trying to steal my motorcycle}
\par\pard\plain \li540\fi-270\sa180\ltrch\loch \ls1\ilvl0{\listtext	\f0\fs24\b0 3.	}{\f0\fs24\b0 Only react to announcements when you visibly see that someone is driving all the way up and is no longer friendly}
\par\pard\plain \sa180\sb180\ltrch\loch {\f0\fs24\b0 Digging FUCK YOU, to all the people who just stood around and filmed!}
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0 But props go out to the first responders who also made a good call to the control center, because there came 1 fire engine + 3 RTW \loch\af0\hich\af0\dbch\af0\uc1\u769\'B4s + 2 NEF \u769\'B4s incl then (unfortunately) another RTH.\line Current condition: Critically injured, but still alive.}
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0 EDIT: I absolutely do not want to put myself in the center here, I am explicitly more concerned with creating awarness in such situations (even if you don't know first aid) to act!\line The fact that you can e.g. keep an overall view of the situation (as in the case where they wanted to steal my motorcycle) and instruct rescue equipment.}
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0 In addition, there are comments such as "So the usual cityscape?". Please refrain from such comments, even if I have to say myself that I don't like people (despite my profession what an irony) and they are completely out of place here.}
\par\plain {\f0\fs24\b0 Be safe and Kind Out there! <3}}